(7610946, 1231294, 3306, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of your composition but there are a few things that make it less appealing for me. I personally would have liked it better if you had cropped out the dark area on the right. I feel it takes away from the beauty of your subject. Also, the bottom edge is not quite level.  I really like the subtle contrast and lighting as well as the texture and shadows of the backround. Overall, this is one of my favorites.</td>', 'I really like the idea of your composition but there are a few things that make it less appealing for me. I personally would have liked it better if you had cropped out the dark area on the right. I feel it takes away from the beauty of your subject. Also, the bottom edge is not quite level.  I really like the subtle contrast and lighting as well as the texture and shadows of the backround. Overall, this is one of my favorites.', '2019-01-29 05:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
